msgid "Default 114. Drives expected farrow date and due-window filters."
msgstr "默认 114。决定预计分娩日期和到期窗口筛选。"

#: lib/peggy_web/live/farm_live/settings.ex:264
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Default 120. Grower batches older than this are flagged for promotion."
msgstr "默认 120。超过此日龄的生长猪批次将被标记升级。"

#: lib/peggy_web/live/farm_live/settings.ex:277
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Default 200. Finisher batches still on farm past this age are flagged for departure (sale / slaughter)."
msgstr "默认 200。超过此日龄仍在场的育肥猪批次将被标记离场（销售/屠宰）。"

#: lib/peggy_web/live/farm_live/settings.ex:193
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Default 21. Lactating sows older than this trigger a “wean due” task."
msgstr "默认 21。超过此天数的哺乳母猪触发“待断奶”任务。"

#: lib/peggy_web/live/farm_live/settings.ex:180
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Default 24. Used to back-fill farrow date when only a wean date is known."
msgstr "默认 24。当仅知断奶日期时用于回填分娩日期。"

#: lib/peggy_web/live/farm_live/settings.ex:165
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Default 3. Farrowing must land within ±this many days of served_at + gestation."
msgstr "默认 3。分娩必须落在 served_at + 怀孕期 的 ±此天数内。"

#: lib/peggy_web/live/farm_live/settings.ex:206
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Default 365. DOB offset for back-filled (inferred) sows."
msgstr "默认 365。回填（推断）母猪的出生日期偏移。"

#: lib/peggy_web/live/farm_live/settings.ex:234
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Default 60. How far back the weaning form's batch picker looks when suggesting pools to consolidate into."
msgstr "默认 60。断奶表单的批次选择器在建议合并批次时回溯的天数。"

#: lib/peggy_web/live/farm_live/settings.ex:219
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Default 7. Re-services within this window collapse into the prior service event instead of creating a new row."
msgstr "默认 7。此窗口内的复配并入先前的配种事件，而非创建新行。"

#: lib/peggy_web/live/farm_live/settings.ex:249
